OL,3,GNEWSAFlour grinding moves closer after
OL,4,Amill's river work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA river under one of the country's
OL,7,Foldest watermills has been dammed as
OL,8,Fpart of work that is hoped will see
OL,9,Fflour being ground once again.
OL,11,FThe River Itchen has been temporarily
OL,12,Fblocked so that a new sluice gate can
OL,13,Fbe installed at Winchester City Mill.
OL,15,FIt will also allow work on the mill's
OL,16,Fhuge water wheel, which will enable
OL,17,Fflour production to restart after a
OL,18,Fpause of several years.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
